            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Sorry? What were you saying just now...?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7111504",
      "subQuestName": "Capture the butterflies",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "711150401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "711150401": {
            "id": "711150401",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Uh... Huh? Who art thou who disturb my beauty sleep...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150402"
            ]
          },
          "711150402": {
            "id": "711150402",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh!? Wh—Who's that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150403"
            ]
          },
          "711150403": {
            "id": "711150403",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Agh!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150404"
            ]
          },
          "711150404": {
            "id": "711150404",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Waaaah!!!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150405"
            ]
          },
          "711150405": {
            "id": "711150405",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Hahahahaha! Yes, yes! To fear me is only natural! Were I unconfined to this stone, you would already be in mine belly!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150406"
            ]
          },
          "711150406": {
            "id": "711150406",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What...? Ah! So you're just a talking stone statue... Paimon thought you were a monster of some sort!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150407"
            ]
          },
          "711150407": {
            "id": "711150407",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Hmph! What dost thou mean, \"just a talking stone statue\"!? Would not one such be frightening in itself?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150408"
            ]
          },
          "711150408": {
            "id": "711150408",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, we've come across many statues like you before, is the thing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150409"
            ]
          },
          "711150409": {
            "id": "711150409",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Wh—What!? *sigh* Fine. Seems like there's no scaring you guys...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150410"
            ]
          },
          "711150410": {
            "id": "711150410",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why must you do that, anyway? Sheesh! You're just a stone statue!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150411"
            ]
          },
          "711150411": {
            "id": "711150411",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Hmph! Even if I was \"just a stone statue,\" this place is still the Herblord's abode! When she was yet with us, she did not appreciate others disturbing her peace at their liberty!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150412"
            ]
          },
          "711150412": {
            "id": "711150412",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "And that's why I scare all the pesky ones away! I shall continue to do so even if she isn't around anymore!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150413"
            ]
          },
          "711150413": {
            "id": "711150413",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Nevertheless, your presence does feel somewhat different from that of those ordinary mortals, and considering that I couldn't scare you either...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150414"
            ]
          },
          "711150414": {
            "id": "711150414",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "May I please ask you for a favor?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150415"
            ]
          },
          "711150415": {
            "id": "711150415",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? What can we help you with?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150416"
            ]
          },
          "711150416": {
            "id": "711150416",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Ahem. Take a look at these colorful butterflies! Ever since the abode's lord departed, these little things have scattered all over the place, flying about as they please...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150417"
            ]
          },
          "711150417": {
            "id": "711150417",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Shh... Hang on, there's one on your head! Just a moment. We'll help you get it..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7111518",
      "subQuestName": "Capture the butterflies",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "711150501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "711150501": {
            "id": "711150501",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Phew... Yes, just like that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150502"
            ]
          },
          "711150502": {
            "id": "711150502",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "The abode's Herblord previously used these colorful butterflies to adorn its door, but said mechanism was later destroyed. These colorful butterflies and the medicine jar... were originally meant to nourish the adeptal tree.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150503"
            ]
          },
          "711150503": {
            "id": "711150503",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Adeptal tree?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150504"
            ]
          },
          "711150504": {
            "id": "711150504",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Heh, that's right! Back then, the Herblord planted this adeptal tree herself...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150505"
            ]
          },
          "711150505": {
            "id": "711150505",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "It may be withered now, but the Herblord said that so long as the colorful butterflies haven't all dispersed, the tree can be revived!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150506"
            ]
          },
          "711150506": {
            "id": "711150506",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "*sigh* She departed as soon as she lost the power to maintain her human form. I wonder how she's doing these days...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150507"
            ]
          },
          "711150507": {
            "id": "711150507",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"As the vivid butterflies converge in the jar, new life shall be restored to the withered tree...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150508"
            ]
          },
          "711150508": {
            "id": "711150508",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Yep, that's right! As long as... Wait, how did you know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711150509"
            ]
          },
          "711150509": {
            "id": "711150509",
            "speakerId": 21344,
            "speakerName": "Carefree Simulacrum",
            "text": "Never mind. Anyway, that's about it! As long as those colorful butterflies get put back into the jar, we can then nourish that withered tree! I'm counting on you, kind humans!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7111506",
